20
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:37.970
Not Marie, guys, sorry, Marie Kondo is my happy place.

21
00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:38.803
Yes!

22
00:00:38.803 --> 00:00:41.430
And she's doing a collab with The Container Store.

23
00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.843
Which we dorked out over on Drew's News.

24
00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:44.676
Oh yeah!

25
00:00:44.676 --> 00:00:47.970 line:15%
You love The Container Store, and guess what, VFFs?

