30
00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:58.350
Okay, we still have one more gift.

31
00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.330
This one is for you though, Drew.

32
00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.800
I wanna say hello to our final surprise.

33
00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:06.330
Live from city hall, please welcome the mayor

34
00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:08.902
