35
00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:09.922
(audience cheers and applauds)

36
00:01:09.922 --> 00:01:10.755
Hi!

37
00:01:10.755 --> 00:01:13.270
Hi Ms., Madam Mayor, how are you?

38
00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:16.320
I am great, it's an honor and a pleasure to be here

39
00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:20.730
with you today to celebrate the one and only Drew Barrymore.

40
00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.150
She grew up here, this is her hometown.

41
00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:25.950
We know this is a place where she,

42
00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:27.860
we hold her dear in our hearts,

43
00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:31.880
and West Hollywood is just so, so proud of the success

44
00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.160
that Drew has had.

45
00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:35.740
And while many people know us for fabulous gay men,

46
00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:39.371
I myself am partial to powerhouse women, so.

47
00:01:39.371 --> 00:01:40.204
(Drew laughs)
(audience applauds)

48
00:01:40.204 --> 00:01:42.470
And Mayor Horvath, I know there's a special reason

49
00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:44.330
