50
00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:45.430
and a special gift for her.

51
00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:46.760
Can you tell us?

52
00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:50.890
Yes, so we have a very official proclamation

53
00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:53.510
to make today here in the city of West Hollywood.

54
00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:55.380
Allow me to read.

55
00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.210
Whereas Drew Barrymore,

56
00:01:57.210 --> 00:02:00.640
who grew up on North Poinsettia Place in West Hollywood

57
00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:03.700
is recognized as a celebrated actress, producer,

58
00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:06.690
director, talk show host, and entrepreneur.

59
00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:09.510
And whereas Ms. Barrymore has a special connection

60
00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:11.720
to the city of West Hollywood.

61
00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:14.500
Now therefore be it resolved that the city council

62
00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:18.673
of the city of West Hollywood declare February 22nd, 2021,

63
00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:23.025
Drew Barrymore Day in West Hollywood, California.

64
00:02:23.025 --> 00:02:26.313
(Drew shrieks)
(audience claps and cheers)

65
00:02:26.313 --> 00:02:27.646
It's your day!

66
00:02:34.042 --> 00:02:35.935
Thank you, I.

67
00:02:35.935 --> 00:02:39.656
I just officially had a heart attack.

68
00:02:39.656 --> 00:02:42.030
All right, having your own day is great,

69
00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:43.540
but there's even more.

70
00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.770
Mayor Horvath, what else do you have for Drew?

71
00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:46.603
Oh my God.

72
00:02:46.603 --> 00:02:50.400
Today, we would like to bestow upon you, Ms. Barrymore,

73
00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.450
a key to the city of West Hollywood.

74
00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:54.665
Thank you for being such a wonderful ambassador

75
00:02:54.665 --> 00:02:59.665
for our community.
(audience claps and cheers)

76
00:03:05.735 --> 00:03:07.865
Happiest of happy birthdays.

77
00:03:07.865 --> 00:03:08.698
Aw.

78
00:03:09.873 --> 00:03:11.530
I love that you're in a top hat, giving me this,

79
00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:15.380
so it feels just so, it really does feel "Wizard of Oz,"

80
00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.070
thank you, Mayor Horvath.
You're so welcome.

81
00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:18.123
I'm very grateful.

82
00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:22.510
I loved growing up in West Hollywood.

83
00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:27.360
It was such a interesting community to grow up in.

84
00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:30.040
It was really open-minded and open-hearted,

85
00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:32.630
