We forgot the cake.

89
00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:39.690
Can we roll out the cake?

90
00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:40.553
Without a cake.

91
00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:43.165
(audience cheering and applauding)

92
00:03:43.165 --> 00:03:44.871
Oh.
It's a pretty one.

93
00:03:44.871 --> 00:03:46.200 line:15%
Thank you, it's so beautiful.

94
00:03:47.774 --> 00:03:48.943 line:15%
Drew, you are loved.

95
00:03:48.943 --> 00:03:51.620 line:15%
You are loved, happy birthday.

96
00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:52.480 line:15%
And this is your show,

97
00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:54.240
