103
00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:08.531
So thank you.

104
00:04:08.531 --> 00:04:09.364
(audience cheers and applauds)

105
00:04:09.364 --> 00:04:10.197
We love you, Drew.

106
00:04:10.197 --> 00:04:11.210
I hope you just are soaking it in.

107
00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:13.830
I hope you absorb it when you lay your head down

108
00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:16.350
