111
00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:21.508
Every day is Drew Barrymore Day.

112
00:04:21.508 --> 00:04:22.660
(Ross laughs)

113
00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:25.200
Definitely the best day of my life.

114
00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.530
And I really just wanna say thank you to Chris,

115
00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:31.490
